      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A residential gardener complained of immediate stinging when a \"fuzzy tan caterpillar\" fell across his fingers. He presented with painful hemorrhagic papules on the dorsal aspect of his right hand. Lepidopterism from contact with Megalopyge opercularis is described."},
